WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.020
Welcome. For the next two minutes, there
is nothing you need to do.

00:00:11.727 --> 00:00:17.707
Let your shoulders soften. Let your hands
rest, wherever they are.

00:00:20.953 --> 00:00:27.533
We'll breathe together. In through the
nose, for four. Then out, slowly, for six.

00:00:30.346 --> 00:00:31.486
Breathe in.

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:39.096
And let it go. Slowly.

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:47.850
Again. Breathe in.

00:00:53.275 --> 00:00:54.275
And out.

00:01:00.795 --> 00:01:04.635
If a thought arrives, that's fine. Notice

00:01:04.635 --> 00:01:09.075
it, and let it float past, like a leaf on
the water.

00:01:12.421 --> 00:01:13.561
Breathe in.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:20.010
And out.

00:01:26.531 --> 00:01:28.011
One more. In.

00:01:33.329 --> 00:01:35.089
And all the way out.

00:01:41.546 --> 00:01:46.666
Feel the weight of your body, and the
ground holding you up.

00:01:50.967 --> 00:01:55.747
When you're ready, take one easy breath,
and open your eyes.
